_AQJGxeiuW-PNCFJH3YnrVNl2vy8g1fOxF0Ino3i-8qh1WA&oe=6AB668AD"}, {"file_name": "\u5546\u5e975.png", "id": "2036065477192261", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824328_2036065483858927_8957851505787159134_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zG4CN9vJUpkQ7kNvwH6TrZh&_nc_oc=AdplbHgLVefRzGqHxi_hD39V62-r4tTZTS7tk2eMKIIXUdtndvkdU7hWm4R4o9uhFLg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIEFtCfNXnfeJj5V1Xx08c38YhVffI09-NTv_ZFUytL5g&oe=6AB680F2"}, {"file_name": "\u5546\u5e973\u6539.png", "id": "1254635553362929", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823905_1254635560029595_7280874972960144612_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=31hAuFZNX44Q7kNvwFDLlYa&_nc_oc=AdoPa5vW3DwqPsBUdWIu8UShH8TvaAlo871nlprbejcadkmUz-gSHDPP2kgnyL2GMj8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIivDmVcdVYM4WV1WyCSLD0Q186a5Y03fQXFReMxe-Q9w&oe=6AB69EFE"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "withlogo.png", "id": "1267105875597409", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618499_1267105878930742_2297389372164605810_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VbgkBjad5XcQ7kNvwGWZfNs&_nc_oc=AdqniRCjXrJ0TA6jZHlYVaJcazBfXcY6ouei65_xFrBJObjYLGLqFBwFt92ry3PPZwc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJMMVvrkIVkfgAHSt7LS0MEQHnZFtnFWYHpN2QR_Xdotw&oe=6AB66979"}, "display_name": "The Hole Never Ends", "keywords": ["Horror", "Survival", "adventure", "simulator", "sandbox"], "long_description": "**The Hole Never Ends \ud83d\udc80**\n\n**ARCTON Industries** drilled too deep. Beneath the Karst Rift Zone, and the crews they sent in never came back. They sealed the site and buried the records. Now you're sent down: dig out what the dark is hiding, meet your quota, and extract alive.\n{1065020969617239}\n\n**\ud83d\udc65 Extract with a crew \u2014 up to 4**\n\nMine enough to hit your quota, then fight your way back to the extraction gate and get out. Gear up at the shops below and hold your ground \u2014 you're not the only thing after the ore.\n\n{1046495998198121}\n{1742504013639604}\n\n\ud83e\ude93 **Every run**\n- **Piece together what ARCTON buried** \u2014 The company hid its secrets down here, along with the crews it sent to dig them up.\n{923339950450962}\n- **Greed vs. escape** \u2014 The richer the seam, the deeper and longer you stay. Reach for one more haul, or cut and run \u2014 greed is how the cave keeps you.\n{1274417862428344}\n{2030886427611609}\n- **Trade and upgrade** \u2014 Sell your finds, buy better picks, drills, gear, and weapons from the merchants underground.\n\n{1436914165249749}\n\n\n- **It hunts you** \u2014 Patrolling horrors, an ore-thief that robs you blind, and bosses lurking off the main route. Even standing still isn't safe.\n{852916377815237}\n{1188689029777811}\n{1497756828174354}\n\n\n\u26a0\ufe0f WARNING\n Not a casual VR adventure. Expect screams, racing heartbeats, and fear that lingers after the headset comes off.\n\ud83d\udc49 Descend. Meet your quota. Escape with treasure \u2014 if you can.\n\nContains content made by SCP Foundation.\nhttp://www.scp-wiki.net\n\nThis game is licensed under a Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0 International License.\nhttps://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/legalcode\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n", "short_description": "The Hole Never Ends \u2014 a VR survival horror descent beneath the Karst Rift Zone. Dig deep for rare minerals and lost relics, trade and upgrade your gear, and choose treasure or escape as the dark closes in. Descent solo or with up to 4 \u2014 but the more you haul up, the harder the dark hunts you, and the cave may not let you leave. Find out what ARCTON buried down here\u2026 if you make it back."}]}, "developer_name": "Smartmelon Games", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://thesmartmelon.com/cave_privacy_en", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Tyc